{
  "$comment": [
    "TRAVIS fast path (nlu/command_matcher.py): a command matched here runs its tool straight away, with no LLM. Anything that doesn't match goes to the local LLM, which has the same tools plus the ability to ask and explain.",
    "Phrases are matched after normalization: lowercase, number words -> digits, filler words (the, a, to, please, can, you, travis, ...) removed. (a|b) = alternatives, [word] = optional, {slot} = parameter from 'slots'. Entries are tried top to bottom and the first exact match wins, so keep specific phrases above general ones.",
    "tool + args: the tool main.py runs (device_control / screen_control / shutdown_travis) with args; an arg that is exactly \"{slot}\" (or \"{a|b}\" = the first one spoken) is replaced by the slot's value and dropped when it wasn't spoken. defaults: slot values used when not spoken.",
    "say: spoken instead of the tool's own message when the tool succeeds (a failure always speaks the CMS's message, which names the real options). reply: answered with no tool at all. {timeGreeting} = good morning/afternoon/evening now.",
    "Names are passed exactly as the canonical alias below; apps/api's voice-aliases.ts resolves them to the real devices/screens. fuzzy: false = exact matches only (the door, shutdown)."
  ],
  "rewrites": {
    "a c": "ac",
    "air con": "ac",
    "t v": "tv",
    "tasker": "tusker",
    "and lock": "unlock",
    "on lock": "unlock",
    "un lock": "unlock"
  },
  "slots": {
    "brightness": { "type": "number", "min": 0, "max": 100 },
    "temperature": { "type": "number", "min": 16, "max": 30 },
    "steps": { "type": "number", "min": 1, "max": 10 },
    "volume": { "type": "number", "min": 0, "max": 100 },
    "color": {
      "type": "enum",
      "values": {
        "red": ["red"],
        "green": ["green"],
        "blue": ["blue"],
        "neutral white": ["white", "neutral white", "cool white", "cold white", "cool", "cold"],
        "warm white": ["warm white", "warm"],
        "yellow": ["yellow"],
        "orange": ["orange"],
        "purple": ["purple", "violet"],
        "magenta": ["magenta", "pink"],
        "cyan": ["cyan"]
      }
    },
    "mode": {
      "type": "enum",
      "values": {
        "cool": ["cool", "cooling", "cold"],
        "heat": ["heat", "heating", "hot", "warm"],
        "auto": ["auto", "automatic"],
        "fan": ["fan", "fan only"],
        "dry": ["dry", "dehumidify"]
      }
    },
    "fan": {
      "type": "enum",
      "values": {
        "auto": ["auto", "automatic"],
        "low": ["low", "slow", "quiet"],
        "mid": ["mid", "medium"],
        "high": ["high", "fast", "strong", "max"]
      }
    },
    "target": { "type": "text", "aliasesFrom": "light" },
    "screen": { "type": "text", "aliasesFrom": "screenAlias" },
    "content": { "type": "text" },
    "namedScreen": { "type": "text", "anchor": ["screen", "display"], "aliasesFrom": "screenAlias" },
    "light": {
      "type": "enum",
      "values": {
        "tusker edge": ["tusker edge", "edge", "edge tusker", "tusker edge light", "strip", "cove light", "cove lights", "cove", "cove light tusker"],
        "tusker L1": ["tusker l 1", "tusker el 1", "tusker l1", "tusker ll 1", "l 1", "el 1", "l1", "ll 1", "l 1 tusker", "el 1 tusker", "l1 tusker", "ll 1 tusker", "tusker ell 1", "ell 1", "ell 1 tusker", "sky light front", "skylight front", "front sky light", "front skylight", "sky front"],
        "tusker L2": ["tusker l 2", "tusker el 2", "tusker l2", "tusker ll 2", "l 2", "el 2", "l2", "ll 2", "l 2 tusker", "el 2 tusker", "l2 tusker", "ll 2 tusker", "tusker ell 2", "ell 2", "ell 2 tusker", "sky light back", "skylight back", "back sky light", "back skylight", "sky back"],
        "tusker L3": ["tusker l 3", "tusker el 3", "tusker l3", "tusker ll 3", "l 3", "el 3", "l3", "ll 3", "l 3 tusker", "el 3 tusker", "l3 tusker", "ll 3 tusker", "tusker ell 3", "ell 3", "ell 3 tusker", "tusker l tree", "tusker el tree", "l tree", "el tree", "ell tree", "stretch fabric", "fabric", "fabrics", "stretch fabrics", "sky light", "skylight", "sky lights", "skylights"]
      }
    },
    "ambientMode": {
      "type": "enum",
      "values": {
        "pre-entry": ["pre entry", "preentry"],
        "entry": ["entry", "welcome"],
        "meeting": ["meeting", "conference"],
        "presentation": ["presentation", "present"]
      }
    },
    "screenAlias": {
      "type": "enum",
      "values": {
        "tusker 86": ["tusker 86", "86 tusker", "tv", "tv 86", "86 inch", "86 inch tv", "big screen", "main screen", "main display", "main tv", "main television"],
        "tusker 27": ["tusker 27", "27 tusker", "kiosk", "screen 2", "27 inch"]
      }
    }
  },
